### FILE 2 — shared/storage/StorageService.js
MinIO wrapper with AES-256-CBC encryption at rest.

| Method | Description |
|---|---|
| `uploadDocument(practitionerId, docType, buffer, mimeType)` | Validates MIME (jpeg/png/webp/pdf) + size (10MB max), encrypts with AES-256-CBC (IV\|\|ciphertext), uploads to MinIO |
